Backport of GHC b3f7fb80781bac756efdd7fdde836bf4742a75fc (2024-10-24, "determinism: Interface re-export list det",
Fixes #25304; in 9.14.1, not 9.10/9.12), without its DetOrdAvails newtype: sort the avails of the docs structure in
interface files (sortAvails, moved from mkIfaceExports to GHC.Types.Avail). Measured on solnix (ghc1 --check): the docs
section of 7 System.Posix* interfaces of unix (x3 ways) listed the re-exported OpenFileFlags/FdOption avails in a
different order in each of 3 builds.

